<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#061527">
<meta name="description" content="Katalog virtual 15.000 modul OS MEDIA VM dengan nama jalur bahasa Indonesia, deskripsi, biner UTF-8, dan hubungan konseptual IC.">
<title>Katalog Modul · Perpustakaan Planetbintang</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#06111f;--panel:#0b1e31;--line:#25435c;--ink:#edf7ff;--muted:#a9c1d8;--cyan:#66e1ff;--blue:#429bff;--gold:#ffc978}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 0,#153d61 0,transparent 44%),linear-gradient(145deg,#050d18,#07182a 70%,#08101c);color:var(--ink);font:15px/1.65 system-ui,sans-serif}.shell{width:min(1400px,100%);margin:auto;padding:clamp(14px,3vw,32px)}a{color:var(--cyan)}button,input,select{font:inherit}button{cursor:pointer}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:18px}.kicker{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--cyan);font-weight:800}.top h1{font-size:clamp(25px,4vw,42px);line-height:1.12;margin:5px 0}.muted{color:var(--muted)}.link,.btn{display:inline-block;border:1px solid #3d6d8e;background:#10304a;color:var(--ink);padding:9px 13px;text-decoration:none}.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr .6fr;gap:14px;margin:18px 0}.panel{border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0c2338ee,#081625f2);padding:clamp(14px,2.5vw,24px);min-width:0}.hero h2{font-size:clamp(23px,3vw,34px);line-height:1.15;margin:8px 0}.ic{display:grid;place-items:center;min-height:160px;text-align:center}.chip{width:92px;height:92px;border:2px solid var(--cyan);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:26px;font-weight:900;color:var(--cyan);background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,#0a2134 0 8px,#123651 8px 10px);margin:auto}.stats{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:12px 0}.stats span{padding:8px 11px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#0a1b2d;color:#c7e9ff}.controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px}.controls label{display:grid;gap:5px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}input,select{width:100%;min-height:42px;padding:10px;background:#030d17;border:1px solid #34516a;color:var(--ink)}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(280px,.85fr) minmax(0,1.15fr);gap:14px;align-items:start}.list,.detail{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#091827;padding:14px;min-width:0}.items{display:grid;gap:5px;max-height:60vh;overflow:auto}.item{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;text-align:left;padding:10px;background:#0a1929;border:1px solid #203c54;color:var(--ink);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.item.active,.item:hover{border-color:var(--cyan);background:#12314a}.item small{color:var(--muted)}.pager{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}.pager button{background:#10304a;border:1px solid #3d6d8e;color:var(--ink);padding:8px 11px}.pager button:disabled{opacity:.4}.detail h2{font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.15;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:9px}.grid section{border:1px solid #203d55;background:#071625;padding:11px;min-width:0}.grid h3{font-size:12px;color:var(--cyan);margin:0 0 5px}.grid p{margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:#c1d5e7}.binary,pre{font:12px/1.8 ui-monospace,monospace;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;color:var(--gold)}pre{padding:12px;background:#06121e;border:1px solid #3c6582;white-space:pre-wrap;color:#bfeaff}.note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}footer{margin-top:22px;padding-top:15px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
@media(max-width:800px){.hero,.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.controls{grid-template-columns:1fr}.items{max-height:38vh}}@media(max-width:520px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
</head>
<body><main class="shell">
<header class="top"><div><div class="kicker">PLANETBINTANG · /AKTIF/MODUL/</div><h1>Katalog Modul Sistem</h1><p class="muted">Penelusur 15.000 entri OS MEDIA VM dengan jalur nama berbahasa Indonesia.</p></div><a class="link" href="../index.html">← Kamus Digital Modern</a></header>
<section class="hero"><div class="panel"><div class="kicker">PERPUSTAKAAN SISTEM</div><h2>Nama, fungsi, dan hubungan modul dalam satu katalog.</h2><p class="muted">Pilih modul untuk membaca deskripsi rinci, jalur folder virtual, biner UTF-8, dan rumus konseptual yang menghubungkan kata dengan lambang IC. Jalur virtual membantu katalog tetap ringan; entri ini bukan berarti seluruh 15.000 folder telah dipindahkan secara fisik.</p><div class="stats"><span>15.000 entri katalog</span><span>12 kelompok sistem</span><span>Bahasa Indonesia</span><span>🌐 Ikon dunia</span></div></div><aside class="panel ic"><div><div class="chip">IC</div><h3>MAGNET · IC · KATA</h3><p class="muted">Kata → makna → data → komponen visual.</p></div></aside></section>
<section class="controls"><label for="q">Cari nama, fungsi, atau jalur<input id="q" type="search" placeholder="Contoh: perangkat, pencarian, penyimpanan…"></label><label for="cat">Kelompok sistem<select id="cat"><option value="">Semua kelompok</option></select></label></section>
<div class="stats"><span id="count">Memuat katalog…</span><span id="source">Sumber: registri OS MEDIA VM</span></div>
<section class="layout"><aside class="list"><h2>Daftar modul</h2><div class="items" id="items"></div><div class="pager"><button id="prev">Sebelumnya</button><span id="page">Halaman 1</span><button id="next">Berikutnya</button></div></aside><article class="detail" id="detail" aria-live="polite"><div class="kicker">PENAMPIL MODUL</div><h2>Pilih satu entri</h2><p class="muted">Deskripsi sistem akan tampil di sini.</p></article></section>
<footer>Catatan data: katalog 15.000 modul dibuat oleh registri OS MEDIA VM. Jalur nama di halaman ini merupakan pemetaan virtual yang mudah dibaca. Untuk mengklaim 250.000+ lema resmi KBBI, diperlukan sumber lema KBBI yang sah dan dapat diverifikasi; kombinasi imbuhan otomatis tidak dianggap sebagai lema resmi.</footer>
</main>
<script src="../../desktop-os-menus.js"></script>
<script>
(()=>{'use strict';const api=window.PBDesktopOSMenus;if(!api){document.getElementById('items').textContent='Registri menu tidak tersedia.';return;}
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id),size=40;let page=0,chosen=null,filtered=[];
const esc=s=>String(s??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
const slug=s=>String(s).normalize('NFD').replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g,'').toLocaleLowerCase('id').replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g,'-').replace(/^-|-$/g,'');
const binary=s=>Array.from(new TextEncoder().encode(String(s))).map(n=>n.toString(2).padStart(8,'0')).join(' ');
api.categories.forEach(c=>{const o=document.createElement('option');o.value=c.name;o.textContent=c.name;$('cat').append(o)});
function getAll(){const q=$('q').value.trim().toLocaleLowerCase('id'),c=$('cat').value;const out=[];for(let i=0;i<api.total;i++){const x=api.get(i);if(c&&x.category!==c)continue;if(q&&![x.display,x.category,x.systemFunction,x.integration,x.data,x.id].some(v=>String(v).toLocaleLowerCase('id').includes(q)))continue;out.push(x)}return out;}
function draw(){filtered=getAll();const pages=Math.max(1,Math.ceil(filtered.length/size));page=Math.max(0,Math.min(page,pages-1));const rows=filtered.slice(page*size,(page+1)*size);$('count').textContent=filtered.length.toLocaleString('id-ID')+' modul cocok · 15.000 total terdaftar';$('page').textContent='Halaman '+(page+1)+' / '+pages;$('prev').disabled=page===0;$('next').disabled=page>=pages-1;$('items').innerHTML=rows.map(x=>'<button class="item '+(chosen&&chosen.id===x.id?'active':'')+'" data-index="'+(x.index-1)+'"><b>'+esc(x.display)+'</b><small>'+esc(x.category)+' · '+esc(x.id)+'</small></button>').join('')||'<p class="note">Tidak ada modul yang cocok.</p>';$('items').querySelectorAll('[data-index]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>show(api.get(Number(b.dataset.index)))));if(!chosen&&rows.length)show(rows[0]);}
function show(x){chosen=x;const path='/aktif/modul/'+slug(x.display)+'/';const bits=binary(x.display);$('detail').innerHTML='<div class="kicker">'+esc(x.id)+' · '+esc(x.category)+'</div><h2>'+esc(x.display)+'</h2><p>'+esc(x.systemFunction)+'. Modul ini dikelompokkan pada '+esc(x.category)+'. '+esc(x.data)+'.</p><div class="grid"><section><h3>FUNGSI SISTEM</h3><p>'+esc(x.systemFunction)+'; mendeskripsikan tanggung jawab modul dan kaitannya dengan kategori induk.</p></section><section><h3>INTEGRASI</h3><p>'+esc(x.integration)+'; penghubung konseptual antara menu, data lokal, dan ruang kerja.</p></section><section><h3>JALUR NAMA BERBAHASA INDONESIA</h3><p>'+esc(path)+'<br><span class="note">Jalur katalog virtual; belum tentu folder fisik di Git.</span></p></section><section><h3>REPRESENTASI BINER UTF-8</h3><p class="binary">'+esc(bits)+'</p></section></div><h3>Blok rumus kata ↔ logo IC</h3><pre>KATA := "'+x.display.replace(/["\\]/g,'\\$&')+'"
KATEGORI := "'+x.category+'"
KATA → NORMALISASI → INDEKS → DATA
DATA → [ IC / LOGO ] → PANEL MODUL
UTF8(KATA) = ['+bits+']
STATUS := "TERDAFTAR"</pre><p class="note">Notasi IC adalah model penjelasan aliran data pada antarmuka, bukan simulasi gerbang logika fisik. Untuk daftar kata KBBI resmi, gunakan kamus digital dan tautan rujukan pada halaman Perpustakaan.</p><p><a href="../../system-menus/'+esc(x.categorySlug)+'/index.html">Buka kategori sistem lama ↗</a></p>';}
$('q').addEventListener('input',()=>{page=0;chosen=null;draw()});$('cat').addEventListener('change',()=>{page=0;chosen=null;draw()});$('prev').addEventListener('click',()=>{page--;draw()});$('next').addEventListener('click',()=>{page++;draw()});draw();
})();
</script></body></html>